{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/重构•幻光万华镜","pageid":6458,"revid":14730,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%87%8D%E6%9E%84%E2%80%A2%E5%B9%BB%E5%85%89%E4%B8%87%E5%8D%8E%E9%95%9C&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%87%8D%E6%9E%84%E2%80%A2%E5%B9%BB%E5%85%89%E4%B8%87%E5%8D%8E%E9%95%9C&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%87%8D%E6%9E%84%E2%80%A2%E5%B9%BB%E5%85%89%E4%B8%87%E5%8D%8E%E9%95%9C&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>重构•幻光万华镜</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E9.87.8D.E6.9E.84.E2.80.A2.E5.B9.BB.E5.85.89.E4.B8.87.E5.8D.8E.E9.95.9C\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"重构•幻光万华镜\"><b>重构•幻光万华镜</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 重构•幻光万华镜.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/92/eh46hz2ho29onzgvyk6wchr30eg0vlb.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E9%87%8D%E6%9E%84%E2%80%A2%E5%B9%BB%E5%85%89%E4%B8%87%E5%8D%8E%E9%95%9C.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/92/eh46hz2ho29onzgvyk6wchr30eg0vlb.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E9%87%8D%E6%9E%84%E2%80%A2%E5%B9%BB%E5%85%89%E4%B8%87%E5%8D%8E%E9%95%9C.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/92/eh46hz2ho29onzgvyk6wchr30eg0vlb.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />重构•幻光万华镜\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>4\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-5\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓5-↑3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓5-↑5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（支援）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放枷锁\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放枷锁</font></span></span>]，选择[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">空地</span>]并标记技能释放后[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"光棱晶石\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">光棱晶石</font></span></span>]传送至标记点，并使[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"光棱晶石\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">光棱晶石</font></span></span>]获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲物防2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲物防2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲魔防2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲魔防2</font></span></span>],持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>回合，再触发其[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"晶棱折射\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">晶棱折射</font></span></span>]所有剩余次数及额外<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>次无消耗次数，每次造成<font color=\"#d68fe2\">120%</font>魔法伤害，若重复攻击相同目标，每次伤害倍率降低<font color=\"#d68fe2\">50%</font>，最低至20%。<br />✦拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">10</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]时，消耗10层并在攻击前，对目标施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼魔防3\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼魔防3</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合,对任意目标首次攻击时，造成伤害、攻击提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">40%</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-5 3.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/7d/9d6tdon38aaqpdxdifhy9x2qbdntq4k.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-5_3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"79\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/7d/9d6tdon38aaqpdxdifhy9x2qbdntq4k.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-5_3.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/7d/9d6tdon38aaqpdxdifhy9x2qbdntq4k.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"127\" data-file-height=\"126\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%8F%B6%E8%BF%A6%E5%86%85\" title=\"角色图鉴库/叶迦内\"><img alt=\"头像 叶迦内.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/bc/pqec6mc2vv7z2ocf2sl1l6sgwdt96ny.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">叶迦内</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261021173925\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.460 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.617 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 10109/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 174093/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 22160/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40